meta {
  name: getCategories
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getCategories",
    "params": {
      "limit": 5
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Retrieve the product category tree

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–1000) |
  | `product_category_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by product category IDs |
  | `super_category_id` | integer (nullable) | no | Filter to children of this super-category ID |
  | `include_category_images` | boolean | no | Include category images in the response |
  | `include_category_translations` | boolean | no | Include translated category names; requires include_languages |
  | `include_category_seo` | boolean | no | Include SEO fields for categories; requires include_languages |
  | `include_languages` | string[] (nullable) | no | Language codes to include in translations (e.g. ["nl", "fr"]) |
  | `include_contexts` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Context IDs to include (default: [1]) |
  | `include_attachments` | boolean | no | Include attachments linked to the category |
  | `include_attachment_translations` | boolean | no | Include translated attachment names; requires include_languages |
  | `include_attachment_types` | string[] (nullable) | no | Only include attachments of these types; omit to include all types |
  | `include_internal_attachments` | boolean | no | Include internal (non-public) attachments |
  | `include_products` | boolean | no | Include products linked to the category |
  | `include_custom_classes` | boolean | no | Include custom classification features for the category |
  | `include_custom_class_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Only include custom classes with these IDs |
  | `include_custom_collection_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Only include custom classes from these collection IDs |
  | `include_etim_features` | boolean | no | Include ETIM features bound to the category |
  | `include_custom_features` | boolean | no | Include custom features bound to the category |

  **Example: Root categories**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getCategories",
    "params": {
      "limit": 5
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "categories": [
      {
        "product_category_id": 1,
        "super_category_id": 1,
        "parent_category_id": null,
        "product_category_code": "CABLES",
        "depth": 0,
        "left": 1,
        "right": 2
      },
      {
        "product_category_id": 2,
        "super_category_id": 1,
        "parent_category_id": null,
        "product_category_code": "CONNECTORS",
        "depth": 0,
        "left": 3,
        "right": 4
      }
    ],
    "page": {
      "number_of_items": 2,
      "items_per_page": 5,
      "number_of_pages": 1,
      "current_page": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
